<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Reclaim the land, our portion,</l><l>God as our rich possession.</l><l>Feast on Him ev’ry day!</l><l>Enjoy Him with God’s fam’ly;</l><l>Find satisfaction and peace.</l><l>Here forever to stay!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
